            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a nice lunch salad. I doubled the tuna and used a bagged salad mix with carrots. I tried with Catalina dressing, and it's okay. I'd like to try with a vinaigrette when I eat the leftovers.",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-17T17:11:56.227Z"
          },
