            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LadyHawk2006"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted chicken salad for tuna, mayo for french dressing, left out the cucumber (I don't like \"crunchy things\" in my chicken/tuna salads) and added a bit of cilantro. My husband and I liked this a lot, and he doesn't usually like chicken salad. The eggs seemed to make it creamy. Very tasty, will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-20T18:26:24.540Z"
          },
          {
